32815919c2ee6aaf3f","node_id":"C_kwDOS7iax9oAKDgzM2NhNjBhY2YzYjEwZTJjMWE1MmQzMjgxNTkxOWMyZWU2YWFmM2Y","commit":{"author":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T04:13:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T04:13:16Z"},"message":"feat(settings): per-workspace settings UI with inheritance (NIW2-601)\n\nSettings for <workspace> at the top of the index, a blue dot and a scope tag on the\nper-workspace pages, a source line on every overridable row (Set for Work, Same as default,\nOverridden in Work), Copy to all workspaces, Reset, a section banner counting what differs,\nand the sheet that asks once before a folder's own settings apply. The Cloud page edits the\nworkspace's upload mode the same way. Copy in en and es.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c527524d4ac9099695ca6d51cbe020b14f9c872c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/c527524d4ac9099695ca6d51cbe020b14f9c872c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/833ca60acf3b10e2c1a52d32815919c2ee6aaf3f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/833ca60acf3b10e2c1a52d32815919c2ee6aaf3f","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/833ca60acf3b10e2c1a52d32815919c2ee6aaf3f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/833ca60acf3b10e2c1a52d32815919c2ee6aaf3f/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u