@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T04:33:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-02T04:33:58Z"},"message":"fix(settings): serialize override writes, record the hash before the file, bound the capture-start probe (NIW2-601)\n\nReview findings on #482: two edits of one workspace could interleave and switch its own\noverrides off; a failed hash record after the file write read as a sync change; a pending file\nkept uploadMode from clearing; keptOwn named workspaces that held nothing; the capture-start\nread did not bound the availability probe; copy to all did not check its source; the Settings\nscope hook fetched settings once per component; and a few docs, copy and test nits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"854fcae8804b10e977514d13bfed93afbce94a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/854fcae8804b10e977514d13bfed93afbce94a0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/a0bcd77589d1000cfb0cf5de881980ed06258812","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/a0bcd77589d1000cfb0cf5de881980ed06258812","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/a0bcd77589d1000cfb0cf5de881980ed06258812","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/a0bcd77589d1000cfb0cf5de881980ed06258812/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gis